@startuml 04-reasoning-chain
title MAESTRO Core Reasoning Chain

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #455A64
    FontStyle bold
}

rectangle "Product\n(prod:Product)" as Product #E3F2FD
rectangle "Process\n(proc:ManufacturingProcess)" as Process #E1F5FE
rectangle "Capability\n(cap:Capability)" as Capability #FFF9C4
rectangle "Skill\n(skill:AtomicSkill / CompositeSkill)" as Skill #FFE0B2
rectangle "ControlComponent\n(ROS · PLC FB · IEC 61499 FB · OPC UA method)" as Ctrl #F8BBD0
rectangle "Resource\n(res:Machine / Robot / Sensor)" as Resource #C5E1A5
rectangle "Motion\n(motion:LinearMotion / JointMotion / …)" as Motion #B3E5FC

Product   --> Process     : requires
Process   --> Capability  : requires
Capability --> Skill      : realizedBy
Skill     --> Ctrl        : implementedBy
Ctrl      --> Resource    : controls
Resource  --> Motion      : performs

@enduml
